OL,3,GNEWSAVeteran in 'wrong place' before
OL,4,Adeadly attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice say a military veteran who was
OL,7,Ffound dead in woodland was "just in the
OL,8,Fwrong place at the wrong time" when he
OL,9,Fwas violently attacked.
OL,11,FGraham Pennycook, 64, is believed to
OL,12,Fhave been assaulted in the woods next
OL,13,Fto Pernham Down polo field near
OL,14,FLudgershall, Wiltshire, while walking
OL,15,Fhis dog on 24 September.
OL,17,FTwo months later, Wiltshire Police have
OL,18,Fnot arrested anyone and are still
OL,19,Fappealing to the public to help
OL,20,Fidentify any suspects, despite knocking
OL,21,Fon 1,200 doors and gathering more than
OL,22,F1,000 hours of footage.
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,350,340,200,160,0,100
